WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Guile begins raw Drive Rush toward standing Marisa.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.450
Forward medium kick hits standing Marisa from the Rush.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.080
Standing medium punch links after the knee.

4
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching medium punch continues the close confirm.

5
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.050
Perfect light Sonic Boom connects after the crouching medium.

6
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.900
Standing heavy kick reaches after the Boom.

7
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.700
Light Sonic Hurricane hits Marisa horizontally.

8
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.800
Heavy Sonic Hurricane follows as Marisa is airborne.

9
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.250
Marisa lands after the two Level 1 Supers.
